  "releaseNotes": "### v0.0.21\n    * Fixed bare-LF protocol line parsing so message content is preserved when no carriage return is present.\n    * Fixed handling for empty protocol lines and malformed short protocol lines.\n    * Fixed inline header message parsing to avoid advancing the reader twice for matched subscriptions.\n    * Fixed pooled header buffer cleanup so buffers are returned even when inline header message handlers throw.\n\n\t\t### v0.0.1\n\t\t* Initial commit",
